      "text": "Transfer to Visconde de Mauá, a mountain region known for its abundance of trails, rivers, waterfalls and natural pools of crystal-clear water. Its bucolic scenery comes with a touch of sophistication, thanks to charming inns, bars, restaurants and craft shops. Spend the day enjoying the waterfalls, to relax and have fun. Overnight at the Pousada Verde que te Quero Verde.",
